# Source: https://github.com/wellmanifest/lifecycle
# Revision: 4b5e131a670afb46ca87291479fed7c0fefcf370
# Compatibility projection; domain conformance remains authoritative.

LIFECYCLE legal-obligation VERSION 1
DESCRIPTION "Location-bound legal obligation and grant compatibility projection"
STATE UNBOUND INITIAL
STATE BOUND
STATE ACCEPTED
STATE RESTRICTED
STATE WITHDRAWN TERMINAL
STATE EXPIRED
STATE DENIED TERMINAL
EVENT BIND_JURISDICTION
EVENT ACCEPT_POLICY
EVENT GRANT_LICENSE
EVENT RESTRICT
EVENT WITHDRAW
EVENT EXPIRE
EVENT DENY
EVIDENCE JURISDICTION_EVIDENCE
EVIDENCE POLICY_ACCEPTANCE
EVIDENCE LICENSE_GRANT
EVIDENCE POLICY_DECISION
EVIDENCE WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
EVIDENCE EXPIRATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION UNBOUND -> BOUND ON BIND_JURISDICTION REQUIRES JURISDICTION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION UNBOUND -> DENIED ON DENY REQUIRES POLICY_DECISION
TRANSITION BOUND -> ACCEPTED ON ACCEPT_POLICY REQUIRES POLICY_ACCEPTANCE
TRANSITION BOUND -> RESTRICTED ON RESTRICT REQUIRES POLICY_DECISION
TRANSITION BOUND -> EXPIRED ON EXPIRE REQUIRES EXPIRATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION ACCEPTED -> ACCEPTED ON GRANT_LICENSE REQUIRES LICENSE_GRANT
TRANSITION ACCEPTED -> RESTRICTED ON RESTRICT REQUIRES POLICY_DECISION
TRANSITION ACCEPTED -> WITHDRAWN ON WITHDRAW REQUIRES WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
TRANSITION ACCEPTED -> EXPIRED ON EXPIRE REQUIRES EXPIRATION_EVIDENCE
TRANSITION RESTRICTED -> WITHDRAWN ON WITHDRAW REQUIRES WITHDRAWAL_DECISION
TRANSITION EXPIRED -> BOUND ON BIND_JURISDICTION REQUIRES JURISDICTION_EVIDENCE
END
